~Version ---------------------------------------------------
VERS.   2.0 : CWLS log ASCII Standard -VERSION 2.0
WRAP.    NO : One line per depth step
DLM . SPACE : Column Data Section Delimiter
~Well ------------------------------------------------------
STRT.M                1100.00000 : START DEPTH
STOP.M                2599.50000 : STOP DEPTH
STEP.M                   0.50000 : STEP
NULL.                    -999.25 : NULL VALUE
COMP.         SYNTHETIC SCENARIO : COMPANY
WELL.              SYNTH-WELL-03 : WELL
FLD .                            : FIELD
LOC .    LOCAL X=3200 M, Y=400 M : LOCATION
PROV. SYNTHETIC - NOT FIELD DATA : PROVINCE
CNTY.                            : COUNTY
STAT.                            : STATE
CTRY.                            : COUNTRY
SRVC.                            : SERVICE COMPANY
DATE.                            : DATE
UWI .                            : UNIQUE WELL ID
API .                            : API NUMBER
~Curve Information -----------------------------------------
DEPT     .M     : Measured depth
TVD      .M     : True vertical depth
TWT      .MS    : Two-way travel time
DTC      .US/F  : Compressional slowness
DTS      .US/F  : Shear slowness
RHOB     .G/CC  : Bulk density
GR       .API   : Gamma ray
PHIT     .V/V   : Total porosity
RT       .OHMM  : Deep resistivity
SW       .V/V   : Water saturation
CALI     .IN    : Caliper
BS       .IN    : Bit size
DRHO     .G/CC  : Density correction
PEF      .B/E   : Photoelectric factor
LITHCODE .CODE  : Synthetic lithology code
FLUIDCODE.CODE  : Synthetic fluid code
